WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.214 --> 00:00:02.594
- They say that when you first
open a can of surströmming,

00:00:02.594 --> 00:00:04.462
it's one of the worst smells in the world.

00:00:04.462 --> 00:00:05.461
- Let's not do it then.

00:00:05.461 --> 00:00:07.737
- I don't want to. Oh!
- Oh!

00:00:07.737 --> 00:00:09.316
- Oh!
- You've broken the seal.

00:00:09.316 --> 00:00:13.617
- Oh!
- Oh, God!

00:00:13.617 --> 00:00:15.296
- Okay, nope.
- I'm not.

00:00:15.296 --> 00:00:19.673
- Oh God, no!
- Okay, all right.

00:00:19.673 --> 00:00:23.654
- [Voiceover] Oh my God.
(people retching)

00:00:23.654 --> 00:00:25.663
- [Voiceover] It's sewage.
It's sewage in a can.

00:00:25.663 --> 00:00:27.138
- [Voiceover] Oh my God
- [Voiceover] I'm out.

00:00:27.138 --> 00:00:29.180
- [Voiceover] Can we leave?
- [Voiceover] It's so bad.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:30.980
- [Voiceover] Oh, it's
coming, it's traveling!

00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:32.999
- [Voiceover] Oh!
- [Voiceover] It's traveling!

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:35.208
- [Voiceover] Oh God.
Someone turn on the air!

00:00:35.208 --> 00:00:36.787
- I have the worst gag reflex.

00:00:36.787 --> 00:00:39.585
I'm definitely gonna heave.
(retches)

00:00:39.585 --> 00:00:42.115
- It's one of the worst things
I've ever smelled in my life,

00:00:42.115 --> 00:00:44.032
and I can't wait to get out of here.

00:00:44.032 --> 00:00:46.005
- I smelled this from
outside the building.

00:00:46.005 --> 00:00:47.607
- I don't see how you
can eat this indoors.

00:00:47.607 --> 00:00:50.752
- There's a lot of
terrible smells in there.

00:00:50.752 --> 00:00:52.355
- It's like fish.
- Baby diaper.

00:00:52.355 --> 00:00:54.050
- Cheese.
- Durian, the fruit.

00:00:54.050 --> 00:00:55.966
- And dead body.
- It smells like foreskin.

00:00:55.966 --> 00:00:57.812
