a bunch of dog food in.

00:01:07.992 --> 00:01:09.305
- Then another smell
kicks in, and you're like,

00:01:09.305 --> 00:01:10.454
"Oh, that really smells bad."

00:01:10.454 --> 00:01:12.289
- No, it smells like
dook. It smells like poo.

00:01:12.289 --> 00:01:14.645
- Then another one kicks in,
and you're like, "I'm done."

00:01:14.645 --> 00:01:17.340
(retches)
- Have people been puking?

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:21.054
- (retches) I can taste it already!

00:01:21.054 --> 00:01:25.198
(retches) I can't even look at it!

00:01:25.198 --> 00:01:27.160
- The tin looks like it's left over

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:29.920
