00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:33.032
(knife clatters)
- Holy shit.

00:01:33.032 --> 00:01:34.716
- I think it's just in a
soup of its own fermentation.

00:01:34.716 --> 00:01:39.057
- (retches) No, no, I thought there were

00:01:39.057 --> 00:01:41.310
gonna be pieces, it's just soup!

00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:43.898
- Oh, it looks like a booger!
- It's dripping gray juice.

00:01:43.898 --> 00:01:45.594
- This doesn't look like a real color.

00:01:45.594 --> 00:01:48.797
- Vomit.
(retching)

00:01:48.797 --> 00:01:51.854
- It looks like when you walk by a sewer,

00:01:51.854 --> 00:01:55.069
muck and bacteria that has congealed.

00:01:55.069 --> 00:01:55.998
- Taking it out and putting it on

00:01:55.998 --> 00:01:57.890
a plate intensified the smell.

00:01:57.890 --> 00:01:59.551
- Has anyone eaten this actually?

00:02:00.640 --> 00:02:01.660
(fork clatters)

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:07.280
- Nope, not doing it. Sorry guys.

00:02:07.287 --> 00:02:09.045
You gotta draw the line somewhere.

00:02:10.058 --> 00:02:13.239
- (fork clatters) It's worse, it's worse

00:02:13.239 --> 00:02:14.801
than you think it's gonna be.

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:19.099
- It does not taste even a
quarter as bad as it smells.

00:02:19.099 --> 00:02:21.776
- It tastes very briny, extremely salty.

00:02:21.776 --> 00:02:23.575
- You know, I still don't
want to eat more of it.

00:02:23.575 --> 00:02:25.722
I kind of just want to
get out of this room.

00:02:25.722 --> 00:02:26.721
- I can imagine this
probably tastes better

00:02:26.721 --> 00:02:29.473
with side dishes or maybe
rolled up in something.

00:02:29.473 --> 00:02:30.563
(fork clatters)

00:02:30.563 --> 00:02:32.164
- What the fuck is this,
and where is it from?

00:02:32.164 --> 00:02:33.824
And how do I never have this again?

00:02:33.824 --> 00:02:35.442
- (spitting) Scratch
that off the bucket list!

00:02:35.442 --> 00:02:37.044
- I feel like the smell is so overwhelming

00:02:37.044 --> 00:02:39.320
that it's informing my
taste buds to not like it.

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:41.363
- (retches) Do I have to swallow it?

00:02:41.363 --> 00:02:44.079
- No. No, I don't want to.

00:02:44.079 --> 00:02:45.438
- There's kind of a really clean

00:02:45.438 --> 00:02:47.265
fish taste in my mouth at this point.

00:02:47.265 --> 00:02:48.821
At the very beginning, it was,

00:02:49.653 --> 00:02:51.166
I don't even know what that taste was.

00:02:51.166 --> 00:02:54.625
(retches)

00:03:00.416 --> 00:03:01.739
- Why is it hairy?

00:03:01.739 --> 00:03:03.435
- And there are definitely bones in it.

00:03:03.435 --> 00:03:04.595
Should I stick this
whole thing in my mouth?

00:03:04.595 --> 00:03:06.516
- How could this be more heinous?

00:03:07.834 --> 00:03:10.602
(retches)

00:03:10.602 --> 00:03:12.938
It is the worst thing I've ever eaten,

00:03:12.938 --> 00:03:15.108
the worst thing I've ever
smelled or put in my mouth.

00:03:15.108 --> 00:03:16.548
And I am not exaggerating.

00:03:16.548 --> 00:03:18.058
- That is the weirdest thing in the world.

00:03:18.058 --> 00:03:20.588
- It's awful. Ugh!

00:03:20.588 --> 00:03:22.225
- The coolest thing about this

00:03:22.225 --> 00:03:24.459
is that it's pretty badass
if you enjoy it and eat it.

00:03:24.459 --> 00:03:26.235
I mean, not many people in the world,

00:03:26.235 --> 00:03:27.372
I think, could stomach this.

00:03:27.372 --> 00:03:28.219
- Yeah, my final thought is that

00:03:28.219 --> 00:03:29.276
I never want to have this again.

00:03:29.276 --> 00:03:31.807
So let's close it, and close
this chapter on our lives.

00:03:31.807 --> 00:03:32.945
(can lid scraping)
Together.

00:03:32.945 --> 00:03:35.081
- It's something that's
culturally sensitive,

00:03:35.081 --> 00:03:36.045
and people should respect that

00:03:36.045 --> 00:03:38.619
